<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of</p>
<p>four-day Supersport Series cricket matches on Monday.</p>
<p>In East London: Border 400 and 192-5 declared. Griqualand</p>
<p>West 253 and 299 (Wendell Bossenger 82, Micky Arthur 67; Makhaya</p>
<p>Ntini 4-73). Border won by 40 runs.</p>
<p>In Paarl: Free State 254 and 264. Boland 264 and 256-5</p>
<p>(Adrian Kuiper 117 not out, Andrew Wessels 56 not out; Kosie</p>
<p>Venter 4-109). Boland won by five wickets.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Natal 407 and 241-8 declared. Transvaal 241</p>
<p>and 261 (Daryll Cullinan 78; Shaun Pollock 4-60, Pat Symcox</p>
<p>4-76). Natal won by 146 runs.</p>
<p>In Port Elizabeth: Eastern Province 432-9 declared and 161-2</p>
<p>declared. Northern Transvaal 272 and 115 (Eldine Baptiste 5-37).</p>
<p>Eastern Province won by 206 runs.</p>
</text>
